  <VFEM2_AmnesiaDraught.ingestible.ingestReportString>正在服用{0}</VFEM2_AmnesiaDraught.ingestible.ingestReportString>
  
  <!-- EN: antitox draught -->
  <VFEM2_AntitoxDraught.label>解毒灵药</VFEM2_AntitoxDraught.label>
  <!-- EN: A clear, vibrant teal liquid. When the user drinks it, it enhances their resistance to toxins, fortifying their body against harmful substances. Additionally, this draught actively works to remove any existing toxic buildup within the user’s system, purifying their body and preventing the detrimental effects of toxins. -->
  <VFEM2_AntitoxDraught.description>一瓶清澈的水鸭色液体。被喝下时会增强服用者对毒素的抗性，也能强化对其它有害物质的抵抗力。除此之外，该灵药还会解除任何服用者体内已有的中毒效果。</VFEM2_AntitoxDraught.description>
  <!-- EN: Use {0_label} -->
