  <!-- EN: coma draught -->
  <VFEM2_ComaDraught.label>昏睡灵药</VFEM2_ComaDraught.label>
  <!-- EN: A deep indigo liquid. When the user drinks it, it induces a chemically controlled coma, significantly slowing down their metabolism. This state allows the body to conserve energy and potentially aid in healing processes under controlled conditions. -->
  <VFEM2_ComaDraught.description>一瓶深沉的靛蓝色液体。被喝下时会使服用者陷入可控的昏迷之中，并减慢新城代谢的速度。这种昏睡能让人体更好地保存能量，也能便于他人实施医疗手段。</VFEM2_ComaDraught.description>
  <!-- EN: Use {0_label} -->
  <VFEM2_ComaDraught.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>服用{0_label}</VFEM2_ComaDraught.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
