  <!-- EN: healing draught -->
  <VFEM2_HealingDraught.label>治愈灵药</VFEM2_HealingDraught.label>
  <!-- EN: A vibrant red liquid. When the user drinks it, it greatly enhances their injury healing rate, speeding up the process of wound closure and tissue repair. This potion works by boosting the body’s natural healing mechanisms, making recovery from injuries much quicker. -->
  <VFEM2_HealingDraught.description>一瓶鲜艳的红色液体。被喝下时会催动服用者身体潜能，大幅强化伤口愈合的速度。</VFEM2_HealingDraught.description>
  <!-- EN: Use {0_label} -->
  <VFEM2_HealingDraught.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>服用{0_label}</VFEM2_HealingDraught.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
