  <!-- EN: immunization draught -->
  <VFEM2_ImmunizationDraught.label>免疫灵药</VFEM2_ImmunizationDraught.label>
  <!-- EN: An amber-colored drink with tiny particles floating in it that bolsters the immune system of anyone that drinks it. While it helps them fight off sickness better, the downside is that it makes the user feel much more tired after drinking it, as well as overall makes the user get sleepy much faster than usual. The effects of the draught are strongest immediately after consumption, and then slowly fade away over the following days. -->
  <VFEM2_ImmunizationDraught.description>一瓶有着粒状沉淀物的琥珀色液体。被喝下时会强化服用者的免疫系统。它能使服用者更快地对疾病产生免疫，但同时也会使其更容易疲倦。在服下那一刻产生的药效最强，随着时间推移药效会在几天内不断弱化直至消失。</VFEM2_ImmunizationDraught.description>
  <!-- EN: Use {0_label} -->
