  <!-- EN: inspiration  draught -->
  <VFEM2_InspirationDraught.label>启迪灵药</VFEM2_InspirationDraught.label>
  <!-- EN: A radiant, golden-colored liquid. When the user drinks it, it provides them with mental clarity, sharpening their focus specifically on acquiring new knowledge in areas they are passionate about. However, the draught comes at the cost of diminished combat capabilities, as the user's attention is diverted away from physical prowess and towards intellectual pursuits. -->
  <VFEM2_InspirationDraught.description>一瓶发光的金色液体。被喝下时会催动服用者的思维能力，使头脑更加清醒，更容易在感兴趣的领域获取知识。由于注意力都在自己热爱的知识上，服用者的战斗能力会减弱。</VFEM2_InspirationDraught.description>
  <!-- EN: Use {0_label} -->
  <VFEM2_InspirationDraught.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>服用{0_label}</VFEM2_InspirationDraught.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
