  <!-- EN: poison draught -->
  <VFEM2_PoisonDraught.label>剧毒灵药</VFEM2_PoisonDraught.label>
  <!-- EN: A dark, ominous green liquid. When consumed, it drastically reduces the user's consciousness, inducing a chemically forced coma. This state not only incapacitates the individual but also initiates a rapid decay of their organs. The effects of this draught are severe and irreversible, leading inevitably to death. -->
  <VFEM2_PoisonDraught.description>一瓶粘稠的深绿色液体。被喝下时会使服用者的意识迅速衰弱直至昏迷。在此之后服用者的器官会快速衰竭。该灵药的效果不可逆转，必然导向死亡。</VFEM2_PoisonDraught.description>
  <!-- EN: Use {0_label} -->
  <VFEM2_PoisonDraught.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>服用{0_label}</VFEM2_PoisonDraught.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
