  <!-- EN: torturer draught -->
  <VFEM2_TorturerDraught.label>苦刑灵药</VFEM2_TorturerDraught.label>
  <!-- EN: A dark, foreboding purple liquid. When the user drinks it, it induces severe pain, incapacitating them to the point where movement becomes impossible. For prisoners, this intense agony causes a rapid decline in their will to resist, breaking down any mental barriers they may have. In the case of slaves, the draught completely suppresses their spirit, leaving them entirely subdued. This potion is used with caution due to its extreme effects. -->
  <VFEM2_TorturerDraught.description>一瓶恶心的深绿色灵药。被服下时在服用者体内产生极度的痛苦，使其立刻失去行动能力。如果被囚犯服用，这种痛苦会击碎他们的心理防线，迅速减少抵抗度。如果被奴隶服用，该灵药会使他们放弃一切反抗的念头。这种灵药效果极端，请谨慎使用。</VFEM2_TorturerDraught.description>
